    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Economic planning has played a vital role in shaping India's economy. With Five-Year Plans and NITI Aayog, India has progressed towards self-reliance, growth and modernization.",
      "id": "uyf9o54"
    },
    {
      "id": "dh6dvdi",
      "type": "numberedList",
      "items": [
        "<strong>IMPORTANT POINTS ON ECONOMIC PLANNING</strong>",
        "Economic planning helps in optimum utilization of scarce resources."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "It ensures that limited resources are used in the most productive manner.",
      "id": "yjfn6bd"
    },
    {
      "id": "e8oqhjl",
      "type": "numberedList",
      "items": [
        "Planning helps in correcting market failures."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Government intervention is necessary where private sector fails to invest.",
      "id": "rtqlc3u"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "The famous slogan 'Garibi Hatao' was introduced during the Fifth Five-Year Plan (1974–1979).",
        "Unlike the Planning Commission, NITI Aayog does not allocate funds; fund allocation lies with the Finance Commission.",
        "Twelfth Five-Year Plan (2012–2017) was the last Five-Year Plan of India."
      ],
      "id": "f2fjbw0"
    },
    {
      "id": "vgbzgng",
      "type": "numberedList",
      "items": [
        "Economic planning helps in long-term development instead of short-term profit."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Private sector focuses on profit, while planning focuses on welfare.",
      "id": "uwut1l6"
    },
    {
      "id": "6xld2uu",
      "type": "numberedList",
      "items": [
        "Planning promotes capital formation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Savings are mobilized and invested in productive sectors.",
      "id": "nveh2c9"
    },
    {
      "id": "x8nwaeb",
      "type": "numberedList",
      "items": [
        "It helps in achieving social objectives like equality and justice."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Weaker sections are given special attention.",
