    },
    {
      "id": "vy76kvj",
      "type": "numberedList",
      "items": [
        "Economic planning ensures balanced growth between agriculture and industry.",
        "It helps in achieving self-sufficiency in food and industrial goods.",
        "Planning plays a major role in infrastructure development like roads, power and irrigation.",
        "Economic planning helps in employment generation through public sector projects.",
        "It encourages technological progress and modernization of economy.",
        "Planning ensures coordination among different sectors of the economy.",
        "It helps in controlling inflation through price stability measures.",
        "Economic planning promotes inclusive growth by including poor and backward classes.",
        "<strong>IMPORTANT POINTS ON NITI AAYOG</strong>"
